# Evidence Integrity Checklist

For every acquired evidence object:

* [ ] Assign unique evidence ID.
* [ ] Record source.
* [ ] Record acquisition date/time.
* [ ] Record investigator.
* [ ] Record acquisition method.
* [ ] Record acquisition tool.
* [ ] Record tool version.
* [ ] Record destination.
* [ ] Calculate cryptographic hash.
* [ ] Record hash algorithm.
* [ ] Record hash value.
* [ ] Protect original evidence from modification.
* [ ] Maintain chain of custody.
* [ ] Analyze verified working copies where possible.
* [ ] Document any unavoidable modification to the source.

